{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>limited visibility</strong>, a <strong>ticking timer</strong>, and <strong>multiple connected screens</strong>, you\u2019ll need to memorize the maze, act fast, think ahead, and find an optimal path to leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a risk for score, expand your vision to plan ahead, or rush the exit before time runs out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short levels</strong>, <strong>quick retries</strong>, and <strong>score-based progression</strong> make each attempt a chance to improve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mechanics\u00a0</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boost -</strong> Hit the turbo! Blaze through obstacles with a burst of speed and full-on invincibility!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/4e1ad532f12a4180a152f25d6b712476.poster.avif?t=1771081605\" width=800 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/4e1ad532f12a4180a152f25d6b712476.webm?t=1771081605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/4e1ad532f12a4180a152f25d6b712476.mp4?t=1771081605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vision -</strong>\u00a0Widen your vision and slow down time to expose sneaky shortcuts or give you those extra seconds to react!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/a9821edec2e34f4adf638ed1d3ad74f0.poster.avif?t=1771081605\" width=800 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/a9821edec2e34f4adf638ed1d3ad74f0.webm?t=1771081605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/a9821edec2e34f4adf638ed1d3ad74f0.mp4?t=1771081605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score attack -</strong>\u00a0Collect coins and fruits like a pro, race to crush your best run, and watch the leftover time turn into extra score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/d5fecbf9d94dec8ce67f87dab3def29b.poster.avif?t=1771081605\" width=800 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/d5fecbf9d94dec8ce67f87dab3def29b.webm?t=1771081605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/d5fecbf9d94dec8ce67f87dab3def29b.mp4?t=1771081605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather keys -</strong> Secure the keys needed to unlock your way to the exit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/a6b4a17c54336f3b6bec1afae19bab6f.poster.avif?t=1771081605\" width=800 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/a6b4a17c54336f3b6bec1afae19bab6f.webm?t=1771081605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/a6b4a17c54336f3b6bec1afae19bab6f.mp4?t=1771081605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Portal jump -</strong> Explore multi-screen challenges through portals, there is more than meets the eye!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/d3bdb64144910a0846a2e32b0f264bf4.poster.avif?t=1771081605\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/d3bdb64144910a0846a2e32b0f264bf4.webm?t=1771081605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/d3bdb64144910a0846a2e32b0f264bf4.mp4?t=1771081605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diamond Hunt</strong> - Grab all the fruits in a level to make a diamond pop! Use it to unlock skips and replay your favorite days anytime!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Classic Mode:</strong> Play three distinct modes (<strong>Casual</strong>, <strong>Normal</strong>, <strong>Challenge</strong>). Perfect if you love <strong>structured gameplay</strong> and want to master different maze layouts and puzzles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Arcade:</strong> If you seek a\u00a0<strong>nonstop test of skill</strong>, the endless run mode delivers <strong>fast-paced</strong>, <strong>high-intensity</strong> gameplay where the maze never ends. Compete for the top spot o